#NEXUS

[ martínez2012a_fig16: Panel A only, read by eye: a strict consensus with two polytomies (the herrerasaurs, and the large saurischian polytomy of eight). Dinosauria and Saurischia label nodes and are kept. Panel B shows a second, better resolved tree of the same tips. 16 tips, 2 polytomies (3, 8 children); 2 printed clade names kept as internal node labels. Sample 8 case (census 2, seed 20261251). Topology transcribed from the figure image and checked node by node; topology only. ]

BEGIN TAXA;
    DIMENSIONS NTAX=16;
    TAXLABELS
        Silesaurus
        Ornithischia
        MACN-PV-18649A
        Staurikosaurus
        Herrerasaurus
        Chindesaurus
        Neotheropoda
        Guaibasaurus
        Panphagia
        Eoraptor
        Pampadromaeus
        Chromogisaurus
        Saturnalia
        Pantydraco
        Thecodontosaurus
        other_Sauropodomorpha
    ;
END;

BEGIN TREES;
    TREE martínez2012a_fig16 = [&R] (Silesaurus,(Ornithischia,((MACN-PV-18649A,Staurikosaurus,Herrerasaurus),(Chindesaurus,Neotheropoda,Guaibasaurus,Panphagia,Eoraptor,Pampadromaeus,(Chromogisaurus,Saturnalia),(Pantydraco,(Thecodontosaurus,other_Sauropodomorpha))))Saurischia)Dinosauria);
END;
